The C files in this directory contain functions and type definitions copied
verbatim from NASA's Core Flight System (cFS), specifically the Core Flight
Executive (cFE):

    https://github.com/nasa/cFE
    modules/time/fsw/src/cfe_time_api.c
    modules/core_api/fsw/inc/cfe_time_api_typedefs.h
    modules/time/fsw/src/cfe_time_utils.h

The copied portions are delimited in each file between the markers
"verbatim from cFE" and "end cFE". Everything outside those markers (the
verification harnesses) is original to this project.

